WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:14,820
Fortunately, Qianxin Dao is a high-level zero treasure that can break through this fish's defense.

2
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:17,390
Otherwise, why would I be charged directly today?

3
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,740
But it's finally a blessing in disguise

4
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:25,980
Not in vain

5
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,260
Thanks to your nose, I discovered this treasure

6
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,380
But only then did I see clearly

7
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,780
The wound underneath this fish is so harmful

8
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,340
It is clearly waiting for this zero grass to mature and heal its wounds

9
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,540
I didn’t expect that I got the discount for free.

10
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:42,180
But one blow can damage Level 4 Zero Life to this extent

11
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:45,140
The one hiding under the water is probably even more complicated.

12
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,300
Let's leave quickly

13
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:51,420
Then consider how to deal with this zero-planted plant. The injury is too serious.

14
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:53,020
My body no longer obeys its orders

15
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:55,340
There's still a trace of fire poison on this fish's teeth
